contribution_types.description:
Gamification: Shared vision for TrueSight DAO 

@garyjob @pris My vision and objective of TSD is a successful unicorn app which attracts all folks (Time Wasters) of life in wanting to come together, sharing and be indulged of diverse topics of interests. A playground space where any individual can turn their opinion into prediction for world community to participate. It’s an open approach, a refreshing form of knowledge based entertainment and many would enjoys contributing their share of action at fingertips. Success are on the way as we are pacing it with the development of TSD, prediction X years maybe quite hard for me to say, as many factors involved, as we still have missing parts to be pick up, like funding blah blah blah etc. Impact is huge as human mostly like to share, learn, take references and form opinions from others, as personal researches, counter checking their alter ego, as an alternative to be congruent on, take it as a pinch of salt as a time waster, money making, entertainment, friendships, networking, and can be as a marketing channel for individual and commercial, and the list goes on and on etc.

